# All local development clients share this limited anonymous namespace.
topic readwrite openump/v1/acme/#
topic readwrite hades/dev/#

# Anonymous development access never grants write-control channels.
topic deny openump/v1/+/+/+/+/+/command/#
topic deny openump/v1/+/+/+/+/+/command_receipt/#
# Inference events feed cloud triage, so anonymous clients must not forge them. A static
# Mosquitto deny blocks both publish and delivery; develop events on the secure profile,
# where hades-infer and consumer-primary hold certificate identities.
topic deny openump/v1/+/+/+/+/+/event/#
topic deny openump/v1/+/+/+/+/+/derived/#
